cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its derived products, please cite it as below."
title: "LunarSafeMap: terrain safety and suitability assessment of the Rimae Bode lunar landing region"
abstract: >-
  An undergraduate research repository that builds a reproducible multi-criteria
  safety assessment for the Rimae Bode candidate lunar landing region
  (353-359 E, 8-13 N). It covers PDS data handling and ISIS/ASP stereo
  photogrammetry, multi-scale terrain metrics, automatic crater detection with a
  PyTorch U-Net validated against the Robbins (2018) catalogue by manual sampling,
  an AHP-weighted suitability model, and a Monte Carlo uncertainty analysis of the
  resulting site ranking.
type: software
